  <item>
    <title>#013 千禧时光门 《武林外传》下：前互联网时代探险指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662d48105fb33c1b2bfa7e12</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662d48105fb33c1b2bfa7e12</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Apr 2024 18:46:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这里是我们有关《武林外传》的第二期节目！众所周知，《武林外传》中充斥着无数个小包袱，关于各种文化现象的化用、拼贴和致敬。我们延续了上一期的话题，试图（根本盘不完）以同福ktv里唱响的流行音乐为线索，以年代为节点，反观《武林外传》所折射的文化气象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那就请和我们一起跨过千禧时光门吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调味配方：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 我们心目中的高光剧集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 武林外传的后四十集是发生了什么…？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 影视衍生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 文创衍生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a> 武侠时光探险指南：金庸古龙篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 江湖气息加成的片头片尾曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>同福ktv严选歌单</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2446">40:46</a> 80s</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> 90s</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3716">01:01:56</a> 00s</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4544">01:15:44</a> 上联：汉代画像砖，下联：千禧时光门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4677">01:17:57</a> 来自30岁的常看常新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5086">01:24:46</a> 世界上只有一种英雄主义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调音台：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>黑棒 - 霞飞路87号</span></p><span></span><p><span>邓丽君 - 美酒加咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>同福客栈 - 让世界充满爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>同福客栈 - 世间始终你好</span></p><span></span><p><span>同福客栈 - 祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span>同福客栈 - 最美</span></p><span></span><p><span>同福客栈 - 两只蝴蝶</span></p><span></span><p><span>Anat Phutthamat - จุดยืนความรั</span></p><span></span><p><span>茉莉花</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调味意向参考：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rX4y1N79e/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rX4y1N79e/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>《武林外传》的终极神秘结局，我揭开了埋藏14年的新春礼物！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/review/14886344/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/review/14886344/"><span>《武林外传》引用歌曲·最全-按出现集数排序</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#自由调味会出现在：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 喜马拉雅 | 荔枝播客 | 网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢各位uu们的收听，希望我们有带给你更多的调味自由🆓🎉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以关注我们的公众号/微博/小红书：自由调味GoodTaste</span></strong><span>，以获得我们节目的更多内容。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（快来找我们玩！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们后续也会开放更多的社交媒体平台，有情报会第一时间告诉大家的！</span></p>]]></description>
