  <item>
    <title>#010 为什么提及云南这两个字，我们就开始畅想诗和远方了？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660d7895c891c06e732dae40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660d7895c891c06e732dae40</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 15:41:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在国内的热门旅游目的地不断更迭的浪潮之中，大家对云南的青睐却似乎从未消减。作为精神云南人的我们，似乎一直都还在回味先前的云南旅行，真的好好玩好好吃好怀念啊🥹</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期节目中，除了对先前旅行中美好碎片的反刍与分享，我们也试图回答这一问题，到底是为什么，仅仅是提及云南这两个字，我们就开始畅想诗和远方了？🧐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调味配方：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 应该没有人会不喜欢云南吧！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 什么是云南？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 云南人通往思维世界的利器—野生菌🍄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> 上辈子是个云南人，下辈子也想当云南人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 治愈不开心的景色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> 一些“云南”标签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> 云南山歌小调=当代《诗经》（完整版）？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">43:43</a> 如果“旷野”在云南，那么轨道又在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> “新云南人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3408">56:48</a> 有人的地方就有江湖</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调味意向参考：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MLRNuRR2iK5pwUIKo7bIRg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MLRNuRR2iK5pwUIKo7bIRg"><span>如果旷野是假象</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NNFbZ5JRRGYpdvLbzsQRzg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NNFbZ5JRRGYpdvLbzsQRzg"><span>什么是云南？</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>马坪关小院</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrPaOmoQ9ME2t935BZjddH3yVFfs.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>马坪关女仔</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6RXVdAqgTEvnjU0RpbJyIVgL98.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>牛仔小妮</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_DpU46HTRjqgYX_Ye3QBqWrYSp.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>洱海日落</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnaSFkBahnETO1CgRxeJ7XYACRIC.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>西双版纳中科院植物园</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvgf5lK0w7RZjXA-P9-Uds3RUMAe.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>肖全摄影作品/林妲宛妲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsRU2BYjcwrBLlNouQOrfo6cDiUj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>#自由调味会出现在：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 喜马拉雅 | 荔枝播客 | 网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢各位uu们的收听，希望我们有带给你更多的调味自由🆓🎉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以关注我们的公众号/微博/小红书：自由调味GoodTaste</span></strong><span>，以获得我们节目的更多内容。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（快来找我们玩！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们后续也会开放更多的社交媒体平台，有情报会第一时间告诉大家的！</span></p>]]></description>
