  <item>
    <title>#003 春节返程调音台：我们的“在路上”奇遇记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cb73443af97665afda92ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cb73443af97665afda92ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Feb 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春节返程，你又会乘坐什么交通工具呢？飞机、火车、船、自驾或是仅仅需要地铁，不论哪种方式，我们大概都是在这些交通工具的节点里，匆匆忙忙又带些许窘迫，努力奔赴相聚又随之别离。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调味配方：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 春节前的一次位移</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 火车站和飞机场，一组能证明时间相对论的场所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> 火车上的泡面怎么那么香！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> 啊？这个距离真的需要飞机吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 收入一半靠赚一半靠省的廉价航空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 火车上的典中典经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a> 宁波人说自己坐过最多的船是月湖公园小鸭船也太掉价了吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 坐进铁皮盒子里的私人幻想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 灵魂战车惊现湖北公路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a> 一键找回班味！ft.消失在通勤大道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2821">47:01</a> &nbsp;成为汹涌上班人潮里的小小一员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 通勤/长距离出行中的阅读/影视推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a> 我们好像终于能读懂《静夜思》和《背影》了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">01:04:45</a> 每一次的相聚，就是一次别离</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调味意向参考：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《灵魂战车》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《人的大地》/《风沙星辰》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中西风马牛》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《也许你该找个人聊聊》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《月海与梦游人》 | 《阅微草堂笔记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《恶搞之家》 | 《识骨寻踪》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《真爱至上》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期调音台：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>夏之禹,地磁卡 - 懒散爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>安全着陆 - Re Activated</span></p><span></span><p><span>国蛋 - 偷走</span></p><span></span><p><span>还潮 - 春风不改月湖</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pardon Moi - Rodeo Star</span></p><span></span><p><span>吴建京 - 就要到天亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>濱田金吾 - Machi No Dorufin</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Party - 心情点播</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#自由调味会出现在：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 喜马拉雅 | 荔枝播客 | 网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢各位uu们的收听，希望我们有带给你更多的调味自由🆓🎉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以关注我们的公众号/微博：自由调味GoodTaste</span></strong><span>，以获得我们节目的更多内容。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（快来找我们玩！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们后续也会开放更多的社交媒体平台，有情报会第一时间告诉大家的！</span></p>]]></description>
